From 9e5f23d6899cbb09c6beaf797b574358c38068f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanyog Kale <skale@habana.ai>
Date: Sun, 05 Jun 2022 18:28:51 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "[SW-77251] common: add const and bitops header"

Revert rom recovery implementation for secured firmware update via
inband and OOB.

This reverts commit c705100134cdcaaa5cd38050668a556bba611a6a.

Change-Id: I163c6aa7c645c9ced78ce445e3ea861da3a4d575
